msgstr "; GOG-produkt %s"

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:159
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"PC5 picks the game's cover, background and details by this number (%s%s). "
"If they are another game's, type the number from the game's Steam store "
"link (store.steampowered.com/app/<number>). Empty: PC5 reads the folder "
"again."
msgstr ""
"PC5 väljer spelets omslag, bakgrund och detaljer utifrån det här numret "
"(%s%s). Om de hör till ett annat spel, skriv numret från spelets länk i "
"Steam-butiken (store.steampowered.com/app/<nummer>). Tomt: PC5 läser "
"mappen igen."

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:178
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Saved: used at the game's next start."
msgstr "Sparat: används nästa gång spelet startar."

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:191
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Files: change a game's text files"
msgstr "Filer: ändra ett spels textfiler"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:196
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Game folder"
msgstr "Spelmapp"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:196
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Windows (registry, saves, settings)"
msgstr "Windows (register, sparade spel, inställningar)"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:224
msgctxt "web"
msgid "This folder is empty"
msgstr "Mappen är tom"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:235
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Larger than 8 MB: too large to change here"
msgstr "Större än 8 MB: för stor för att ändras här"

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:239
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Not shown: %s"
msgstr "Visas inte: %s"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:253
msgctxt "web"
msgid "UTF-8 with its mark"
msgstr "UTF-8 med BOM"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:254
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Western (one byte a letter)"
msgstr "Västerländsk (en byte per bokstav)"

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:255
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"%s · %s line ends · %d lines · %s. Saved as it was: the same encoding and "
"line ends. A game reads it at its next start."
msgstr ""
"%s · %s-radslut · %d rader · %s. Sparas som den var: samma teckenkodning "
"och radslut. Ett spel läser den vid nästa start."

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:257
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Close"
msgstr "Stäng"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:265
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Saved."
msgstr "Sparat."

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:273
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Close without saving the changes?"
msgstr "Stänga utan att spara ändringarna?"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:278
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"Wine writes its .reg files while a game plays: change them only when no "
"game is running."
msgstr ""
"Wine skriver sina .reg-filer medan ett spel körs: ändra dem bara när inget "
"spel körs."

#. Web page text.
